{"product_id":"boddy-management-8","title":"Boddy Management 8","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"This part considers why management exists and what it contributes to human wealth and well-being. Management is both a universal human activity and a distinct occupation. We all manage in the first sense, as we organise our lives and deal with family and other relationships. As employees and customers we experience management in the second sense, as members of an organisation, or as one with which we deal\"--\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 193 x 264\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: David Boddy\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781292271811\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages:\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45662143479961,"sku":"EDU-2-A9781292271811","price":130.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68a7db48ec682_Boddy_Management_8_David_Boddy.jpg?v=1755875740","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/boddy-management-8","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}